{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36294","headline":"尚书新创敌楼二首 二 · 方干","name":"尚书新创敌楼二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异境永爲欢乐地，歌钟夜夜复年年。\n平明旭日生牀底，薄暮残霞落酒边。\n虽向槛前窥下界，不知窗里是中天。\n直须分付丹青手，画出旌幢遶谪仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}